#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:5 58d98d01b9e84e619150203c0378e6b7
msgid "STABILIZE Mode"
msgstr "Stabilize 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:7 4c5c522cc31944f6968bd500eb30c9f8
msgid ""
"RC control with simple stabilization. If you let go of the sticks then Plane"
" will level the plane. This is a bit like flying a plane with a lot of "
"dihedral. You will find that while it is possible to do maneuvers like rolls"
" and loops in stabilize mode, the tendency of the plane to right itself will"
" make these maneuvers difficult. For people wanting the plane to mostly fly "
"itself, with the pilot just telling it where to fly, you are better off "
"using the :ref:`FLY BY WIRE_A (FBWA) <fbwa-mode>` mode."
msgstr ""
"带简单稳定的遥控控制。如果您松开摇杆，飞机将自动改平。这有点像飞一架具有大上反角的飞机。您会发现，虽然在 Stabilize "
"模式下可以做横滚和筋斗等机动动作，但飞机自我矫正的趋势会使这些机动变得困难。对于希望飞机主要自行飞行、飞手只需告知飞行方向的人，最好使用 "
":ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:15 91bd722e43e841fb99e1face7132c55f
msgid ""
"In stabilize mode the throttle is limited by the ``THR_MIN`` and ``THR_MAX``"
" settings."
msgstr "在 Stabilize 模式下，油门受 ``THR_MIN`` 和 ``THR_MAX`` 设置限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/stabilize-mode.rst:20 631473175d4940cea1ef75d563cdb9ac
msgid ""
"STABILIZE mode is not a good mode to use for tuning the control loops. You "
"are far better off using :ref:`FLY BY WIRE_A (FBWA) <fbwa-mode>` for that."
msgstr "Stabilize 模式不适合用于调整控制回路。使用 :ref:`FBWA <fbwa-mode>` 模式调参效果好得多。"
